            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dispatch 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Reply from the app.</strong> Open the comments drawer to comment on a post, or press Reply under any comment. Send with ⌘↩.</li>
  <li><strong>Like comments.</strong> Every comment shows a heart and its like count.</li>
  <li><strong>Like posts.</strong> Use the heart in the reader toolbar, or press <kbd>l</kbd>. These are real WordPress.com likes, and liking an x-post likes the original post.</li>
  <li><strong>Starred sites are gone.</strong> They only existed inside Dispatch and were easy to confuse with likes. Saved posts are still here.</li>
  <li>Comments are easier to read, with more space between lines.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
